how is inheritance performed (by using extends in javascript)
method overloading and overriding

How is encapsulation performed ? (using private, e.g hiding bank balance in an account class)
How is abstraction performed ? using interface/ abstract class ? Focuses on exposing essential functionality and hiding complexity


S - single responsibility - one class/ function should handle one responsibility
O - open/closed - open for extension, closed for modification.
L - liskov substitution - an object of a child class should be able to replace an object of its parent class without breaking.(e.g penguin class cannot implement bird interface, it should be flyable and non flyable)
I - Interface segrgateion - a class should not be forced to implement methods it does not need. (e.g. readable/writable storage)
D - Dependency Inversion - High level modules should not directly depend on low level module. for e.g. notification service should not directly depend on email sender.

